{% endif %}| `dsl_source()` | Embedded canonical model text |
| `set_event_checks(machine, checks, user_data)` | Install a complete event table; check last_error |
| `configuration_region_status(configuration, region)` | `INACTIVE`, `PENDING`, `LIVE` or `DONE` for one region |
| `configuration_is_active(configuration, state)` | Non-zero when the state or a descendant is active |
| `configuration_leaves(configuration, leaves, capacity)` | Write active leaf ids; return how many there are |
